{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋で個別握手会があったよっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の方が来てくれて嬉しかったなぁー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話題はこちら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・サンタクロース\n・会長♥︎\n・ヴァンパイア騎士\n・NOGIBINGO!3の泡風呂\n・クリスマスライブ\n・ショートヘア\n・ルウトさんイケメン\n・AKIRAさんイケメン\n・西武ドームや感謝祭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中から声を出せなくてごめんね。\n乾燥と話過ぎと体調不良が重なって。\n喉、気をつけます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊服装と髪型チェック(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部と5部 大人系"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/12/23/4506371/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/12/23/4506371/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊2～4部 サンタクロース"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/12/23/4506371/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/12/23/4506371/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安定の楽屋席四人組."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/12/23/4506371/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中本当に\nみんなありがとう。\n楽しかった！！素敵なクリスマスイブイブでした！\nまた会いにきてね。\n待ってるから。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メリークリスマス♥︎LOVE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/12/23/4506371/0005.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}